@startuml
title SaaS Notes App - Threat Intelligence Oriented Sequence Diagram

actor "User\n(Web / Android)" as User
participant "Auth Service\n(OAuth2 + JWT)" as Auth
participant "User DB\n(Encrypted PII)" as UserDB
participant "Notes Service\n(CRUD + RBAC)" as Notes
participant "Notes DB" as NotesDB
participant "Sync Service\n(Realtime Sync)" as Sync
participant "CleanDB\n(Timed Cleanup)" as Cleaner
participant "Vulnerability Scanner\n(OWASP ZAP)" as ZAP
participant "Kafka Topic\n(Security Logs)" as Kafka
participant "Monitoring / Reporting SaaS\n(OWASP / SIEM)" as Monitor
participant "TI Feed\n(MISP / TAXII)" as TI
participant "Notification Service\n(Alert Trigger)" as Notify
actor "Admin" as Admin

== 1. Login ==
User -> Auth : Login Request
Auth -> UserDB : Validate Credentials
UserDB --> Auth : Return: Auth Success / Failure
alt [Login Failed]
  Auth -> Notify : Send Login Notification
  Notify -> User : Alert (Login Failed)
end
Auth -> User : JWT Token

== 2. Notes CRUD ==
User -> Notes : Create/Edit/Delete Note
Notes -> NotesDB : Store / Update
NotesDB --> Notes : DB Success
Notes --> User : Note Saved

alt [Sync Notes]
  User -> Sync : Trigger Sync
  Sync -> NotesDB : Fetch Notes
  NotesDB --> Sync : Return: Synced Notes
  Sync --> User : Notes Updated

  alt [Sync Failed]
    Sync -> Kafka : Log Sync Failure
    Kafka -> Monitor : Stream Sync Error
    Monitor -> Sync : Retry / Escalate Internally
    Sync --> User : Notification: Sync Delayed
  end
end

alt [Scheduled Cleanup]
  Cleaner -> NotesDB : Timed Data Purge
end

== 3. Threat Scanning ==
opt [Scan After Note Update]
  Notes -> ZAP : Send Notes for Scan
  activate ZAP
  ZAP -> Kafka : Log Findings
  activate Kafka
  Kafka -> Monitor : Stream Logs
  activate Monitor

  alt [Issue Found]
    ZAP -> Notes : Cleaned/Filtered Notes
    Notes -> NotesDB : Store Sanitized Notes
    Monitor -> TI : IOC Match Check
    TI --> Monitor : IOC Match / Threat Found
    Monitor -> Notify : Raise Alert
    Monitor -> User : Alert User
  else [Clean]
    ZAP -> Notes : Forward Scanned Notes
    Notes -> NotesDB : Store Notes
  end

  deactivate ZAP
  deactivate Kafka
  deactivate Monitor
end

== 4. Threat Intelligence Feed ==
Admin -> TI : Fetch New IOC / Feeds
TI --> Monitor : Updated Rules / Feeds
Monitor -> ZAP : Apply Rules for Next Scan

== 5. Administrator Activities ==
Admin -> Notes : Provision User
Admin -> Monitor : Review Alerts
Admin -> ZAP : Trigger Manual Scan

== 6. Alerting ==
Notify -> UserDB : Get Contact Info
Notify -> User : Alert (In-App Notification)
@enduml